WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For those
who don't watch this show,

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.802
and that clip
is the first thing they've seen,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:05.205
they might be surprised to know
that this is a show

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
that takes place
in the Marvel Universe.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-Yes.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:12.345
This is a very trippy show that
exists in that superhero world.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
You played --
Your character was a vessel

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a villain
called The Shadow King.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right. I started out
as a human being, maybe,

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.591
in the first episode
of season one, and then I died.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:28.528
And then, an evil psychic mutant
villain took over my body.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.162 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now I'm just
kind of floating around

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.866 size:75% position:38%
in the Astral Plane,
trying to figure out

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:36.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
how to get out of another
dimension of time and space.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah!
-Well explained.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.807 size:84% position:42%
Very well explained.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
You did a great job.
Do you find this is a show --

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.180
If people ask me about my show,
I say, "Oh, it's a talk show.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:47.847 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I interview guests."

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
You obviously --
Your task is a lot harder.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.053
-Yeah, I know. I just actually
texted Noah Hawley and said,

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:56.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
"How do I explain this show?
Why don't you tell me."

00:00:56.856 --> 00:01:02.362
And he said, "Say it's like
going to home-ec class on acid."

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-A good way to describe it.

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:06.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Noah Hawley,
who's a fantastic writer

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:10.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
and also created the show
"Fargo", he created this show.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.072 line:92%
And he also, when the show --

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
Before the show started,
I guess,

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
he created playlists
for you guys?

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:16.242 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.445 size:88% position:44%
Yeah, that's something
I really like about him.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:21.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
He sent us all these, like,
Spotify playlists

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.584 size:81% position:41%
that I guess were just
kind of to inspire us.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:25.985 line:92%
And a lot of it was, like,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pink Floyd
and really cool songs.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:31.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then tracks of just people
screaming into trash cans.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:36.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
And just, like, kind of really
unpleasant ambient tracks

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:40.834
that's really weird to listen to
in the car when you're driving.

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:42.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, the first time
you put it on,

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
were you surprised
when the first

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.271 line:92%
scream into a trash can came on?

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
I was, I was shocked.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:51.444
I thought someone was behind me,
screaming in a trash can.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:55.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that was Jemaine Clement,
who's a fantastic actor.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of the
Flight of the Conchords guys.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:57.817 size:78% position:39% line:92%
He was in that scene.

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that, obviously, is a very
well-choreographed scene.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.722 line:92%
Do you enjoy that part of it?

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, I --
It was really hard.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never had
professional dance training.

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:11.798
And I don't know if Jemaine has.
I don't think he has.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.332 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:15.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we were just told, like,
"Show up, 10:00 a.m.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:16.469 size:81% position:41% line:92%
for your dance lessons

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
that will go on
for seven hours every day."

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:21.074 line:92%
And we were just thrown in there

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.276
with a bunch
of professional choreographers,

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:25.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we just kind of
had to, like, fake it.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How long --
How many days did you rehearse

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.183 line:92%
before you shot the scene?

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like a week.
Maybe more than a week.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-It was intense.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It paid off.
You looked great.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:35.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks.
-Yeah.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:38.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was scared. It was hard,
but I got through it.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm glad you did.
-Thank you.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:43.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The show does seem fairly
physically demanding.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:49.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, there's a lot of weird,
like, stunts and animals.

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:51.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And just, uh...

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:53.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just rolling around
in the dirt a lot.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:53.973 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't really know
what I'm doing.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.577 line:92%
-I want to ask about this,

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:00.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I have
also done this recently.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:01.581 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I have not seen results.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.783 line:92%
You did -- You took a DNA test.

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:07.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-What brought it about?

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:08.621 line:92%
-I know you've been waiting

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
to hear my results
for a while, Seth.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:12.192 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm gonna tell you
what I am now.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, great.
-Yeah, I did the --

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:16.963 size:84% position:42%
-Did you have to desire
to know what you were?

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.933
-Yeah, well, I heard Oprah said
that it was, like,

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.635
the best Christmas present
to get people or something.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:23.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, gotcha.
-23andMe.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:27.140
-Yeah.
-So I just do whatever she says.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I did it.
I spit into the tube,

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:33.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I sent it
into the science factory.

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Or, you know...

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:37.283 size:88% position:44%
And then, I got it back.
And so here's what I am.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:40.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like 30% Irish...
-Uh-huh.

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:41.888 line:92%
-...which I kind of knew.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:48.161 size:78% position:39%
I'm like 30% Spanish,
I'm 8% West African.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:48.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-All right.

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:52.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, I'm 7% Native American.
-Wow.

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:55.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is really
only interesting to me.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:58.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm so sorry.

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm 1% Ashkenazi Jewish...
-Oh, wow.

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:02.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...which I, like...
-Yeah.

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:03.109 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-...totally didn't know.

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:06.779
I'm really .6, but I'm
rounding up for that one.

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:08.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:12.185
-And I made homemade
matzah ball soup recently, so...

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Wow!

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:16.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you feel it --
[ Applause ]

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.291 line:92%
You all of a sudden knew --

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:20.193
You all of a sudden knew,
"This is a part of me"?

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, once I got
the results in, I was like,

00:04:22.629 --> 00:04:25.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm just gonna go for it."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:28.901
-Do you feel like you'll be
making other sort of commitments

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:31.537 line:92%
to your newfound 1% Judaism?

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.905 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah, um, definitely.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:36.175
I'm gonna do all the stuff
they do, um, in the book.

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:38.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:39.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Mm-hmm.

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I also
had some interesting variance.

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:44.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have a Neanderthal variance
that is associated

00:04:44.684 --> 00:04:47.220
with having less back hair,
which I thought was interesting.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:50.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
And does that track
with, uh, your back?

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:52.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Big-time.
-Yeah.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:54.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
That's spot on.

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:55.161 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's great.

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:57.563
That seems to me to be a DNA
result that I wouldn't need.

00:04:57.563 --> 00:04:59.332
-Yeah,
I don't know what that one does.

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.199 line:92%
-Like, at this point in my life,

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:02.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know where I'm at
on back hair.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:03.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Well, yeah.

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.071 size:75% position:38%
I think, like, maybe
way back in the day,

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:08.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
you needed a lot of back hair
for survival, maybe.

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:08.708 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:10.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As some kind of
defense against...

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.445 line:92%
-I would like to know, like --

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:14.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I get my test back,
I'd like to know

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
what my ear-hair
situation's gonna be.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.685 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:19.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't want to know
about mine.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You don't want to know?
-No, not the ears.

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:25.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you can just brush hair
over it as you get older.

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:27.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-If it gets bad.

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:30.396 size:81% position:41%
-I try to hide my ears
as often as possible.

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:31.230 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is always
so lovely to see you.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
Congrats on all
your percentages.

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-As well as the show.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so great
to see you, Aubrey.

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:41.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-Thanks for being here.

